# Coding standards
- use " instead of ' for strings
- type every function parameter
- every time you add new code add comments and error handling
- log every error and also intermediate steps so the progress
is visable in the console
- log messages should be in english
- prompts will be in romanian
- every function will have a docstring at the begining
- create any major feature into a new file or module for better maintainability

## AI Behavior
- DO NOT remove existing comments or logic unless explicitly asked.
- If a change is complex, explain the logic briefly before providing code.
- Always check @codebase for existing patterns before suggesting new utilities.
- When refactoring, provide the full file content if requested, or use clear diffs.

